CharacterName,Pudge,
ClassDescription,"A DOTA2 butcher who drags foes to his cleaver with Meat Hook, chokes everything nearby with Rot, shrugs off blows behind a Meat Shield, devours his prey with Dismember, and grows ever stronger with every hero-tier kill through Flesh Heap.",
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.",DOTA2 の水元素ヒーロー。激浪となって突進し、筋力と敏捷を自在に変換し、天賦「干満の流転」で能力に応じて移動速度・射程・詠唱距離・減速耐性を高め、敵の姿へ変身することもできる。
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.",DOTA2 の仮面の剣豪。天賦「剣の型」で無傷の勢いを蓄え、魔法を斬り裂く「ブレイドフューリー」や味方を癒やす「ヒーリングウォード」、会心の「ブレイドダンス」と必殺の「オムニスラッシュ」で敵陣を殲滅する。
ClassDescription,"A relentless DOTA2 crimson berserker who thrives alone with One Man Army, taunts entire rooms with Berserker's Call, carves attackers with Pure Counter Helix spins, and executes the weak with Culling Blade.",DOTA2 の猩紅の狂戦士。「一人軍隊」で孤独に強くなり、「バーサーカーズ・コール」で敵群を挑発し、純粋ダメージの「カウンターヘリックス」で攻撃者を斬り刻み、「カリングブレード」で弱った敵を処刑する。
